WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 5=

5
01:54.980 --> 01:56.130
Your Highness, your uncle is here.

6
01:56.540 --> 01:57.210
He's waiting in the main hall.

7
02:01.290 --> 02:02.490
I only returned yesterday.

8
02:03.620 --> 02:04.980
Word certainly travels fast to him.

9
02:18.130 --> 02:18.660
Your Highness.

10
02:19.820 --> 02:20.450
Don't make things worse.

11
02:28.010 --> 02:29.890
Just think of my niece's standing.

12
02:31.060 --> 02:32.290
You're my protege.

13
02:33.130 --> 02:34.450
If you two marry,

14
02:34.610 --> 02:36.010
we'll be family twice over.

15
02:37.290 --> 02:38.010
And then,

16
02:38.820 --> 02:40.570
once she bears you a child...

17
02:44.130 --> 02:46.010
(Princess Danyang arrives!)

18
02:52.260 --> 02:53.570
Uncle!

19
02:54.500 --> 02:56.940
I had a little too much to drink at Cuiyun Tower last night.

20
02:57.450 --> 02:58.980
I slept in this morning.

21
03:00.100 --> 03:01.410
Sorry to keep you waiting, Uncle.

22
03:01.500 --> 03:02.290
Danyang.

23
03:03.290 --> 03:05.170
(Li Zhi, Rites Ministry's Vice Director) You're not getting any younger.

24
03:10.450 --> 03:12.690
And who might this handsome young gentleman be?

25
03:13.170 --> 03:14.780
What a fine-looking young man.

26
03:15.980 --> 03:17.220
You've brought him all this way, Uncle.

27
03:17.380 --> 03:18.500
Aren't you going to introduce us?

28
03:22.780 --> 03:23.890
(That old scumbag!)

29
03:24.500 --> 03:26.100
(He keeps parading men through my residence like merchandise,)

30
03:26.150 --> 03:26.890
(expecting me to choose one.)

31
03:27.220 --> 03:28.470
(Now he's even bringing me boys)

32
03:28.520 --> 03:29.410
(this young?)

33
03:31.820 --> 03:32.690
I am Wei Shu.

34
03:33.260 --> 03:34.260
My respects, Princess Danyang.

35
03:34.940 --> 03:36.540
You're from the Wei clan of Jingzhao?

36
03:37.100 --> 03:37.730
Yes, he is.

37
03:39.660 --> 03:41.010
(Wei Shu, Member of the Wei Clan Branch) (So this is Princess Danyang.)

38
03:42.170 --> 03:43.610
(She's remarkably uninhibited.)

39
03:45.570 --> 03:46.170
Chunhua.

40
03:47.820 --> 03:49.820
Show this young man around my study.

41
03:51.290 --> 03:52.940
I need a word with my uncle.

42
03:53.450 --> 03:53.850
Yes.

43
03:59.100 --> 03:59.690
Sir,

44
04:00.290 --> 04:00.780
this way, please.

45
04:11.940 --> 04:12.610
Uncle.

46
04:13.130 --> 04:15.570
There are quite a few members of the Wei clan at court these days.

47
04:16.290 --> 04:17.140
I hear

48
04:17.540 --> 04:19.100
that brilliant adviser of Lord Yu's

49
04:19.250 --> 04:20.290
belongs to the Wei clan too.

50
04:21.850 --> 04:24.580
How come I've never heard

51
04:24.980 --> 04:26.220
of this young man, then?

52
04:26.610 --> 04:28.370
Wei Qiao, Lord Yu's adviser,

53
04:29.050 --> 04:30.020
is his older clansman.

54
04:30.900 --> 04:33.170
Wei Shu comes from a cadet branch of the clan.

55
04:33.660 --> 04:34.580
But despite his lesser lineage,

56
04:35.220 --> 04:37.170
he's one of my finest students.

57
04:39.780 --> 04:42.220
Every suitor you bring me, Uncle,

58
04:42.930 --> 04:44.700
just happens to be your student.

59
04:45.660 --> 04:46.460
And now,

60
04:46.900 --> 04:48.290
you're even bringing me someone from a cadet branch?

61
04:48.580 --> 04:49.370
What do you know?

62
04:49.780 --> 04:51.340
Sheng'an has no shortage of talent,

63
04:52.540 --> 04:56.410
but a young genius like Wei Shu is one of a kind.

64
04:56.930 --> 04:58.050
With his abilities,

65
04:58.250 --> 05:00.140
he's certain to place among the top three this year.

66
05:02.140 --> 05:03.170
Top three?

67
05:03.540 --> 05:04.900
He hasn't even taken the exam yet.

68
05:05.700 --> 05:06.610
Danyang,

69
05:07.170 --> 05:09.220
you must stop behaving so recklessly.

70
05:10.290 --> 05:11.290
You're a princess.

71
05:11.930 --> 05:14.100
The Mu royal family's reputation rests on your shoulders,

72
05:14.700 --> 05:17.220
as does the honor of our Li family.

73
05:18.850 --> 05:20.490
Now that your mother is gone,

74
05:21.290 --> 05:21.850
the Li family

75
05:22.370 --> 05:23.020
has no one but me

76
05:23.370 --> 05:24.540
and you to depend on.

77
05:24.930 --> 05:26.460
If you keep standing by,

78
05:26.700 --> 05:29.250
how can you face your late mother?

79
05:33.410 --> 05:34.580
You're absolutely right, Uncle.

80
05:34.850 --> 05:36.170
You must trust me.

81
05:36.930 --> 05:38.700
Once Wei Shu passes the imperial exams

82
05:39.250 --> 05:40.100
and secures an official post,

83
05:40.660 --> 05:41.660
he'll have no connections of his own.

84
05:42.250 --> 05:43.490
He'll have to rely on the Li family.

85
05:44.170 --> 05:46.220
That'll make him easy for us to control.

86
05:46.610 --> 05:47.460
He would be

87
05:47.900 --> 05:49.700
the perfect choice for your husband.

88
05:52.930 --> 05:53.900
I understand now.

89
05:54.220 --> 05:54.730
Uncle.

90
05:55.250 --> 05:55.980
You may leave now.

91
05:56.930 --> 05:58.980
Let that young man stay at my residence.

92
05:59.490 --> 06:01.020
I'll spend some time talking to him

93
06:01.540 --> 06:02.370
and getting to know him better.

94
06:03.460 --> 06:03.930
Good.

95
06:04.810 --> 06:05.370
Excellent!

96
06:06.980 --> 06:08.900
If Wei Shu wins your favor,

97
06:09.490 --> 06:10.730
use your personal recommendation

98
06:10.930 --> 06:12.700
to get him into the Imperial Academy.

99
06:13.290 --> 06:15.050
It's worth a thousand submitted essays!

100
06:15.810 --> 06:17.410
He already comes from a noble clan.

101
06:18.050 --> 06:20.340
With honors from the exams and a princess for a wife,

102
06:20.460 --> 06:21.460
his standing will only improve.

103
06:22.020 --> 06:23.580
He'll be a worthy match for you.

104
06:26.730 --> 06:28.580
Chunhua, tell me.

105
06:28.900 --> 06:30.850
Why is everyone so desperate to get into the Imperial Academy?

106
06:31.700 --> 06:32.340
Who?

107
06:40.250 --> 06:42.370
(So he's a little bookworm.)

108
06:52.020 --> 06:52.410
Your Highness.

109
06:55.930 --> 06:57.250
Apart from your studies,

110
06:57.700 --> 06:58.410
what else are you good at?

111
07:00.460 --> 07:01.460
Beyond books and poetry,

112
07:01.810 --> 07:02.490
I have no other talents.

113
07:03.930 --> 07:06.170
Everyone has something they enjoy.

114
07:07.370 --> 07:08.610
I don't believe you have no hobbies.

115
07:09.170 --> 07:10.050
And if you say you don't,

116
07:10.290 --> 07:11.170
then you're lying to me.

117
07:13.580 --> 07:13.900
I...

118
07:14.490 --> 07:15.700
I enjoy studying alchemy in my spare time.

119
07:17.730 --> 07:18.580
Then why don't you

120
07:18.700 --> 07:21.610
make me an elixir of immortality?

121
07:22.810 --> 07:24.100
Once you've made it,

122
07:24.490 --> 07:25.730
I'll reward you by making you my husband.

123
07:27.250 --> 07:28.460
You've misunderstood, Your Highness.

124
07:29.170 --> 07:30.980
Alchemy isn't some mystical sorcery.

125
07:31.700 --> 07:32.810
It can't make people immortal.

126
07:33.220 --> 07:34.050
Really?

127
07:36.220 --> 07:36.980
Why not?

128
07:38.730 --> 07:39.140
People...

129
07:39.900 --> 07:41.410
Everyone... Everyone dies eventually.

130
07:42.540 --> 07:44.020
Don't you want to marry a princess?

131
07:44.810 --> 07:47.460
Instead of saying something sweet to please me,

132
07:48.340 --> 07:51.050
you insist on telling me such grim truths.

133
07:54.700 --> 07:56.780
My mentor arranged this marriage.

134
07:57.810 --> 07:58.730
It's not what I want.

135
07:59.540 --> 08:00.810
I never wanted to take this path.

136
08:02.140 --> 08:02.700
That's all I have to say.

137
08:03.170 --> 08:03.980
I accept whatever punishment you see fit.

138
08:07.490 --> 08:08.540
Why do you keep avoiding me?

139
08:09.610 --> 08:10.730
What am I going to do, eat you alive?

140
08:11.980 --> 08:12.660
Do I look

141
08:12.900 --> 08:15.250
like some wicked woman who forces handsome young men into her bed?

142
08:20.900 --> 08:21.810
Don't worry.

143
08:22.540 --> 08:23.660
As for my uncle's arrangements,

144
08:24.490 --> 08:25.490
I'll take care of everything.

145
08:26.370 --> 08:27.490
Go to the Imperial Academy tomorrow.

146
08:28.140 --> 08:30.140
Just say you're under my patronage, and they'll admit you.

147
08:31.810 --> 08:34.060
As for tonight...

148
08:36.940 --> 08:39.300
Why don't you spend the night here with me?

149
08:57.730 --> 08:58.180
Your Highness.

150
08:59.060 --> 09:00.730
Can we really trust Princess Danyang?

151
09:01.340 --> 09:03.460
Whether she truly intends to help me or not,

152
09:04.010 --> 09:05.420
her hatred for Yu Cheng'an

153
09:06.420 --> 09:07.300
is certainly genuine.

154
09:07.980 --> 09:08.580
Back then,

155
09:09.610 --> 09:10.770
it was Yu Cheng'an

156
09:11.460 --> 09:12.610
who arranged her marriage to North Jing.

157
09:14.220 --> 09:15.030
I've heard that over the years,

158
09:15.080 --> 09:16.490
she suffered terrible abuse there.

159
09:17.130 --> 09:18.580
Had Meng Baiyu not died so suddenly,

160
09:19.730 --> 09:21.610
she might have spent the rest of her life rotting away in North Jing.

161
09:23.370 --> 09:24.770
And when she finally returned,

162
09:26.130 --> 09:27.180
the Empress had already died.

163
09:28.530 --> 09:29.250
Mother and daughter

164
09:30.220 --> 09:31.730
never even got to say goodbye.

165
09:33.530 --> 09:35.700
Once the cherished princess and blessing of Huai Dynasty,

166
09:36.100 --> 09:37.030
she's now become

167
09:37.080 --> 09:38.850
a disgraced, fallen woman.

168
09:40.010 --> 09:41.180
Her hatred for Yu Cheng'an

169
09:43.010 --> 09:44.060
must be genuine.

170
09:46.340 --> 09:47.650
I just wonder...

171
09:48.770 --> 09:49.890
After just one journey,

172
09:51.490 --> 09:52.700
where did she find the courage

173
09:53.730 --> 09:55.060
to take on such overwhelming odds?

174
09:55.650 --> 09:57.580
I've heard rumors among the common people

175
09:58.820 --> 10:00.460
that Princess Danyang's child

176
10:01.010 --> 10:03.010
is destined to rule the realm and establish a new dynasty.

177
10:03.700 --> 10:04.580
Utter nonsense.

178
10:05.580 --> 10:06.530
Only fools would believe that.

179
10:08.940 --> 10:09.490
Your Highness,

180
10:10.010 --> 10:11.270
Princess Danyang has invited Li Zhi's student

181
10:11.320 --> 10:12.010
to stay at her residence.

182
10:20.700 --> 10:21.770
It seems it's time

183
10:22.940 --> 10:24.890
to recall Yang Si from the army.

184
10:38.820 --> 10:39.460
(Mu Wanyao.)

185
10:40.580 --> 10:41.580
(You must gain power.)

186
10:42.730 --> 10:43.770
(You need to find allies.)

187
10:44.980 --> 10:47.060
(Only then will you stand a chance against the "tiger".)

188
10:49.220 --> 10:50.250
(This city)

189
10:52.100 --> 10:53.060
(is your prison)

190
10:54.770 --> 10:55.770
(and your battlefield.)

191
10:57.890 --> 10:58.820
(Yet all you have around you)

192
10:59.530 --> 11:01.300
(are allies who don't trust you,)

193
11:02.460 --> 11:04.010
(a family consumed by greed,)

194
11:05.420 --> 11:07.010
(and aging, ailing loved ones.)

195
11:10.940 --> 11:11.530
(Mu Wanyao.)

196
11:13.130 --> 11:13.850
(What will you do?)

197
11:23.940 --> 11:28.340
(Mingde Gate)

198
11:30.980 --> 11:31.850
Sheng'an.

199
11:33.340 --> 11:34.180
It's been a long time.

200
11:40.890 --> 11:43.130
(This batch should fetch a few extra coins!)

201
11:43.530 --> 11:44.250
(Such fine goods!)

202
11:45.980 --> 11:46.850
(I could charge even more!)

203
11:54.130 --> 11:55.100
(Come take a look!)

204
11:55.250 --> 11:56.010
(Greens for sale!)

205
11:57.730 --> 11:59.130
(Fresh greens!)

206
12:03.300 --> 12:04.300
(Flowers for sale!)

207
12:04.650 --> 12:05.730
(Make way! Coming through!)

208
12:07.650 --> 12:08.820
(Fresh goods!)

209
12:15.460 --> 12:16.960
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

210
12:16.960 --> 12:23.560
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

211
12:33.180 --> 12:36.180
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

212
12:45.800 --> 12:47.960
(To Princess Danyang Respectfully, Yan Shang)

213
12:50.320 --> 12:56.660
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

214
12:59.460 --> 13:03.540
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

215
13:04.010 --> 13:05.940
(Hot steamed buns!)

216
13:06.850 --> 13:09.300
(Freshly steamed buns!)

217
13:11.610 --> 13:12.220
Yan Shang?

218
13:15.130 --> 13:15.820
Wenji!

219
13:18.460 --> 13:19.890
It really is you!

220
13:24.700 --> 13:26.180
I thought my eyes were playing tricks on me.

221
13:27.100 --> 13:28.220
What are you doing here?

222
13:29.650 --> 13:30.370
It's a long story.

223
13:31.100 --> 13:31.850
I've been traveling for two days.

224
13:32.580 --> 13:33.490
Let me get settled first.

225
13:35.100 --> 13:36.250
You've already found a place to stay?

226
13:36.490 --> 13:36.850
Where?

227
13:38.250 --> 13:39.850
There's a temple called Yongshou up ahead.

228
13:40.180 --> 13:41.220
I'm not sure if it's still there.

229
13:41.650 --> 13:42.820
I was hoping to stay there.

230
13:44.890 --> 13:46.010
Yongshou Temple?

231
13:46.890 --> 13:47.530
Brilliant!

232
13:48.010 --> 13:48.940
That's just like you!

233
13:49.460 --> 13:50.250
Of course it's still there.

234
13:52.250 --> 13:53.220
How do you know about Yongshou Temple?

235
13:54.460 --> 13:55.340
I just asked around.

236
13:57.460 --> 13:59.300
(Cuiyun Tower) I rented a private room at Cuiyun Tower.

237
13:59.530 --> 14:00.610
The furnishings are luxurious,

238
14:01.060 --> 14:02.220
but it's noisy all day.

239
14:02.490 --> 14:03.370
I can barely concentrate on my studies.

240
14:04.460 --> 14:05.610
It's been driving me crazy.

241
14:06.370 --> 14:07.180
But the temple is peaceful

242
14:07.420 --> 14:08.060
and has plenty of books.

243
14:08.890 --> 14:10.180
Countless scholars

244
14:10.370 --> 14:11.460
stay there to prepare for the exams.

245
14:12.060 --> 14:12.420
I'd say

246
14:12.770 --> 14:14.650
it's a hundred times better than Cuiyun Tower!

247
14:15.850 --> 14:16.610
And here's another advantage.

248
14:17.580 --> 14:18.490
It's cheap!

249
14:20.490 --> 14:20.980
Wait here!

250
14:20.980 --> 14:22.960
(Cuiyun Tower)

251
14:23.730 --> 14:24.980
I'll go pack my things

252
14:25.220 --> 14:26.940
and move to Yongshou Temple with you!

253
14:28.700 --> 14:30.010
You'd better tell me everything

254
14:30.180 --> 14:31.700
about what happened

255
14:31.980 --> 14:33.530
(Cuiyun Tower) and how you ended up in Sheng'an!

256
14:34.940 --> 14:35.250
All right.

257
14:35.940 --> 14:36.420
I'll wait here.

258
14:44.340 --> 14:45.220
Wei Shu.

259
14:46.130 --> 14:47.490
You're so good at studying.

260
14:47.820 --> 14:50.010
Why are you so slow at learning backgammon?

261
14:50.650 --> 14:51.060
Your Highness,

262
14:51.940 --> 14:52.820
I've never

263
14:53.250 --> 14:54.370
played this game before.

264
14:54.940 --> 14:56.300
What a shame!

265
14:56.730 --> 14:57.610
It's so much fun.

266
14:58.420 --> 14:59.220
Let's play another round.

267
14:59.610 --> 15:00.650
You'll get the hang of it soon.

268
15:04.220 --> 15:05.300
How am I doing as your teacher?

269
15:09.460 --> 15:10.010
Your Highness,

270
15:10.730 --> 15:11.460
you're an excellent teacher.

271
15:13.340 --> 15:15.650
This is how my mother used to teach me.

272
15:17.060 --> 15:17.580
Let's continue.

273
15:58.630 --> 15:59.440
Oh, my!

274
16:00.820 --> 16:01.890
You won.

275
16:04.700 --> 16:05.340
Chunhua.

276
16:20.250 --> 16:20.700
Your Highness.

277
16:32.770 --> 16:33.850
This cloak

278
16:34.300 --> 16:35.490
is your prize for winning.

279
16:36.580 --> 16:37.250
Tomorrow,

280
16:38.130 --> 16:39.300
wear it when you go out.

281
16:43.490 --> 16:44.530
I'm tired. No more games.

282
17:01.060 --> 17:03.400
(Yongshou Temple)

283
17:05.010 --> 17:05.860
She gave me a ride.

284
17:06.290 --> 17:07.290
I got off outside the city

285
17:07.530 --> 17:08.220
and walked for another two days.

286
17:08.700 --> 17:09.380
Who would've thought

287
17:09.730 --> 17:11.180
I'd run into you as soon as I entered the city?

288
17:18.620 --> 17:19.940
Which lucky lady is this for?

289
17:26.810 --> 17:27.660
I've been meaning to ask you.

290
17:28.090 --> 17:30.050
That guest of yours was Princess Danyang!

291
17:30.530 --> 17:31.620
Why didn't you tell me back then?

292
17:34.570 --> 17:35.770
I was already in enough trouble.

293
17:36.140 --> 17:37.420
I couldn't drag you into it too.

294
17:39.050 --> 17:39.460
Fair enough.

295
17:40.180 --> 17:40.980
It was a serious matter.

296
17:41.570 --> 17:42.380
If I were you,

297
17:42.770 --> 17:43.810
I'd have kept my mouth shut too.

298
17:45.700 --> 17:48.490
A princess of such noble birth...

299
17:49.250 --> 17:50.660
If anything had happened to her in the countryside,

300
17:51.220 --> 17:52.140
who could've answered for it?

301
17:52.900 --> 17:54.180
If she were truly so blessed,

302
17:54.700 --> 17:56.290
why would she have been sent to that desolate land

303
17:56.770 --> 17:57.730
to marry a traitor?

304
17:59.530 --> 18:01.490
Well, she was born under an auspicious omen.

305
18:02.090 --> 18:02.900
With a birth like hers,

306
18:04.460 --> 18:06.420
it's hard to say whether she's blessed or cursed.

307
18:17.010 --> 18:17.290
Shang.

308
18:19.420 --> 18:20.980
So, Miss Chunhua...

309
18:22.090 --> 18:23.460
She really is Princess Danyang's maid?

310
18:23.900 --> 18:24.220
Yes.

311
18:27.010 --> 18:28.090
Why do you ask?

312
18:31.250 --> 18:31.530
No...

313
18:32.010 --> 18:32.460
No reason.

314
18:35.530 --> 18:36.010
Wenji.

315
18:36.770 --> 18:37.620
You're good at everything,

316
18:38.050 --> 18:38.980
except lying.

317
18:40.380 --> 18:40.700
Come on!

318
18:41.140 --> 18:42.770
There's really nothing between us!

319
18:43.420 --> 18:43.700
We...

320
18:43.900 --> 18:45.090
We barely know each other!

321
18:45.330 --> 18:47.900
Yet you can't get her off your mind.

322
18:51.330 --> 18:52.250
I'm not discussing this with you.

323
19:01.730 --> 19:02.050
Shang.

324
19:02.900 --> 19:03.460
You know,

325
19:03.770 --> 19:05.090
you really are one lucky fellow.

326
19:05.700 --> 19:07.570
You pulled off something incredible without saying a word.

327
19:11.330 --> 19:12.180
Even my father

328
19:12.730 --> 19:14.330
couldn't get me into the Imperial Academy.

329
19:15.860 --> 19:17.420
Yet you managed it through the princess!

330
19:18.010 --> 19:19.770
It was only a verbal promise.

331
19:20.330 --> 19:21.250
I don't even have anything in writing.

332
19:22.290 --> 19:23.250
Getting into the Imperial Academy

333
19:23.730 --> 19:24.900
may still take some effort.

334
19:26.140 --> 19:27.220
Well, you two know each other now.

335
19:27.900 --> 19:29.220
You can always ask her again

336
19:29.490 --> 19:30.490
to write you a letter of recommendation.

337
19:32.460 --> 19:34.290
At least you can visit Chunhua at the princess's residence.

338
19:34.900 --> 19:35.900
I wouldn't dare face her.

339
19:37.730 --> 19:38.180
Why not?

340
19:40.980 --> 19:41.860
I offended her.

341
19:42.620 --> 19:44.770
If I showed up, she'd probably beat me up.

342
19:55.530 --> 19:57.380
Young men, one after another...

343
19:59.180 --> 19:59.980
What are you muttering about?

344
20:00.900 --> 20:02.330
You've turned away every man

345
20:02.490 --> 20:03.770
your uncle has brought here.

346
20:04.380 --> 20:05.660
Why keep this one?

347
20:07.290 --> 20:09.330
Have you actually taken a liking to him?

348
20:11.330 --> 20:12.220
I have taken a liking to him.

349
20:17.140 --> 20:18.290
What about Yan Shang, then?

350
20:18.810 --> 20:19.660
Why would I want him?

351
20:22.570 --> 20:23.250
In the past,

352
20:24.050 --> 20:25.220
all the men my uncle brought here

353
20:26.090 --> 20:27.330
were nothing but scheming opportunists.

354
20:28.420 --> 20:29.290
But Wei Shu

355
20:30.140 --> 20:30.810
is different.

356
20:32.290 --> 20:33.050
I'm keeping him around.

357
20:33.250 --> 20:34.250
He'll prove useful someday.

358
20:37.730 --> 20:39.140
If the gossips in the capital find out,

359
20:39.290 --> 20:40.180
they'll never stop talking.

360
20:41.980 --> 20:43.490
Do you think I'm afraid of gossip?

361
20:44.530 --> 20:45.660
Surely you don't think

362
20:46.010 --> 20:47.860
I have a good reputation to protect?

363
20:48.730 --> 20:49.290
But...

364
20:49.810 --> 20:50.940
No more buts, Chunhua.

365
20:52.140 --> 20:53.010
From now on,

366
20:53.420 --> 20:54.330
everything will be different.

367
20:56.010 --> 20:56.980
This residence

368
20:57.700 --> 20:58.700
will soon be filled with more and more people.

369
21:09.860 --> 21:10.980
This fine wine from the Western Regions

370
21:11.770 --> 21:14.220
somehow doesn't taste as good as that cheap wine from Lingnan.

371
21:14.770 --> 21:15.140
Your Highness,

372
21:15.530 --> 21:17.770
shall I send someone to Lingnan to buy more?

373
21:18.420 --> 21:18.980
No need.

374
21:19.810 --> 21:20.900
Perhaps it's just my imagination.

375
21:22.250 --> 21:22.940
Once I taste it again,

376
21:24.330 --> 21:25.380
I might find it's nothing special.

377
21:27.730 --> 21:28.290
Oh, Your Highness,

378
21:29.220 --> 21:30.250
Yan Shang has written you a letter.

379
21:30.570 --> 21:31.530
(To Princess Danyang; Yan Shang) The gatekeeper received it today.

380
21:33.860 --> 21:34.700
I don't have time to read it.

381
21:35.530 --> 21:37.730
And stop accepting every little thing sent to my residence.

382
21:58.220 --> 22:00.620
Shang, don't underestimate

383
22:00.810 --> 22:01.860
the imperial exams.

384
22:02.050 --> 22:03.940
It takes more than studying and intelligence.

385
22:05.660 --> 22:06.460
These past few days,

386
22:07.050 --> 22:08.090
I've come to realize something.

387
22:09.980 --> 22:11.140
Sheng'an is full

388
22:11.250 --> 22:12.380
of brilliant scholars

389
22:12.730 --> 22:13.570
and powerful nobles.

390
22:14.380 --> 22:16.290
All those scholars hoping to enter officialdom

391
22:16.660 --> 22:18.250
spend day and night seeking patronage.

392
22:19.420 --> 22:22.050
They compile and copy their poems and essays,

393
22:22.490 --> 22:24.980
then submit them to influential families to gain favor.

394
22:26.220 --> 22:26.660
As the saying goes,

395
22:27.290 --> 22:28.940
"By morning, feast with the mighty.

396
22:29.530 --> 22:31.570
By dusk, wander the dusty streets."

397
22:33.460 --> 22:34.980
If you manage to impress a powerful patron,

398
22:36.050 --> 22:38.530
your chances in the exams improve enormously.

399
22:40.620 --> 22:41.290
You see,

400
22:42.330 --> 22:43.250
the higher your social standing,

401
22:43.860 --> 22:45.490
the better your chances of passing.

402
22:47.090 --> 22:49.220
The most powerful man in Sheng'an

403
22:49.940 --> 22:51.570
must be Lord Yu, Yu Cheng'an, right?

404
22:53.090 --> 22:53.460
Exactly.

405
22:55.010 --> 22:55.700
All these years,

406
22:56.180 --> 22:58.700
those imperial court reports I showed you weren't wasted!

407
23:00.900 --> 23:02.860
The Rebellion of the Seven Garrisons was crushed

408
23:03.250 --> 23:04.380
by the Shence Army.

409
23:04.810 --> 23:05.530
And that army

410
23:05.980 --> 23:07.330
was commanded by Yu Cheng'an himself.

411
23:08.010 --> 23:09.620
After the rebellion was suppressed,

412
23:09.940 --> 23:11.980
Yu Cheng'an retained command of a vast army

413
23:13.250 --> 23:15.420
and was named General of Cavalry and Duke of Zhao.

414
23:15.900 --> 23:17.860
He can even enter court armed, wielding unrivaled power.

415
23:22.860 --> 23:23.730
In private,

416
23:24.250 --> 23:25.530
people call him the emperor behind the throne.

417
23:26.770 --> 23:28.380
Even the man on the throne

418
23:29.770 --> 23:30.700
probably has to yield to him.

419
23:35.570 --> 23:37.220
If he's really that powerful,

420
23:38.180 --> 23:39.700
then seeking his patronage would be hopeless.

421
23:40.620 --> 23:41.460
Never mind ordinary scholars.

422
23:41.980 --> 23:43.380
Even officials in Sheng'an

423
23:43.770 --> 23:44.810
who serve at the same court

424
23:45.730 --> 23:47.620
must find him utterly beyond their reach.

425
23:51.530 --> 23:52.140
You're right.

426
23:56.660 --> 23:57.620
So, Wenji,

427
23:58.460 --> 23:59.460
whose patronage will you seek?

428
24:00.770 --> 24:02.140
I'm a man of honor!

429
24:02.380 --> 24:04.490
Flattering and groveling before the powerful?

430
24:04.660 --> 24:05.730
I'd never stoop so low!

431
24:06.900 --> 24:09.220
Let alone associate with those eunuchs!

432
24:20.980 --> 24:21.330
Shang.

433
24:24.730 --> 24:25.050
I...

434
24:26.250 --> 24:27.980
I wasn't accusing you of using Princess Danyang to get ahead.

435
24:32.420 --> 24:33.140
We're friends.

436
24:33.900 --> 24:34.570
There's no need to explain.

437
24:38.380 --> 24:39.010
All right, Shang.

438
24:39.570 --> 24:41.090
You've spent all day unpacking.

439
24:41.290 --> 24:41.860
Get some rest.

440
24:43.250 --> 24:44.660
I've been hauling luggage all day myself.

441
24:44.810 --> 24:45.490
I'm exhausted.

442
24:51.380 --> 24:52.090
(But Wenji,)

443
24:53.290 --> 24:55.900
(Lord Yu now controls the entire imperial court.)

444
24:56.940 --> 24:58.010
(If you want to enter officialdom,)

445
24:59.140 --> 25:01.140
(how can you possibly keep your hands clean?)

446
25:25.500 --> 25:28.640
(Imperial Academy)

447
25:28.700 --> 25:29.250
(Take care!)

448
25:36.770 --> 25:37.110
(Thank you.)

449
25:37.160 --> 25:37.940
(Mr. Wang! Come here!)

450
25:38.530 --> 25:39.290
(Let's go!)

451
25:39.980 --> 25:40.350
(Morning, Mr. Li!)

452
25:40.400 --> 25:41.010
(Come on, let's go together.)

453
25:41.180 --> 25:41.430
(Let's go.)

454
25:41.480 --> 25:41.720
(Sure.)

455
25:41.770 --> 25:42.860
(Fresh greens!)

456
25:43.700 --> 25:44.290
(Come again!)

457
25:44.290 --> 25:45.420
(Gathering Auspice)

458
25:45.420 --> 25:45.860
Stop right there!

459
25:47.090 --> 25:48.090
Who are you?

460
25:48.810 --> 25:50.940
Why haven't I seen you at the Imperial Academy before?

461
25:54.140 --> 25:54.490
Sir.

462
25:55.940 --> 25:57.700
Princess Danyang recommended me for admission.

463
25:58.250 --> 25:58.730
Young man,

464
25:59.330 --> 26:00.940
do you have proof of your rank and family background?

465
26:01.490 --> 26:02.730
And your registration papers?

466
26:03.530 --> 26:04.010
No.

467
26:04.660 --> 26:06.050
Princess Danyang has vouched for me.

468
26:07.140 --> 26:07.940
If you don't believe me,

469
26:08.490 --> 26:09.620
you may verify it at her residence.

470
26:10.660 --> 26:12.090
The princess's residence sent word yesterday

471
26:12.250 --> 26:14.530
that she'd recommend a young man from a noble family.

472
26:15.250 --> 26:16.980
This must be him.

473
26:17.380 --> 26:18.250
(A young man from a noble family?)

474
26:20.050 --> 26:20.860
A misunderstanding!

475
26:21.090 --> 26:21.670
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice) Just a misunderstanding.

476
26:21.720 --> 26:22.380
Please follow me.

477
26:27.330 --> 26:27.770
Stop!

478
26:29.570 --> 26:32.010
I don't believe I've seen you before, young man.

479
26:32.420 --> 26:34.350
What brings you here?

480
26:34.400 --> 26:34.770
I...

481
26:35.620 --> 26:36.900
I'm here to enroll at the Imperial Academy.

482
26:38.010 --> 26:38.700
Enroll?

483
26:40.090 --> 26:41.330
(That's Mu Wanyao's cloak.)

484
26:42.420 --> 26:43.050
(Then he must be)

485
26:43.900 --> 26:44.670
(the young nobleman)

486
26:44.720 --> 26:46.860
(who's truly won the princess's favor.)

487
26:47.290 --> 26:48.330
Who recommended you?

488
26:48.730 --> 26:49.530
Do you have proof?

489
26:51.620 --> 26:52.460
I... Princess...

490
26:53.940 --> 26:54.220
Her...

491
26:57.380 --> 26:59.250
Who exactly recommended you?

492
26:59.620 --> 27:01.110
Why is it so hard to say?

493
27:01.160 --> 27:01.460
I...

494
27:07.220 --> 27:07.570
Sir.

495
27:08.490 --> 27:09.940
This young gentleman, like me,

496
27:10.530 --> 27:11.810
was also recommended by Princess Danyang.

497
27:13.810 --> 27:15.660
Her residence never mentioned two people.

498
27:16.050 --> 27:17.250
Why would there be two?

499
27:20.050 --> 27:22.010
Because Her Highness is generous with her affections.

500
27:22.290 --> 27:23.770
If you find that scandalous,

501
27:24.380 --> 27:25.770
you're welcome to take it up with her.

502
27:26.620 --> 27:26.940
Well...

503
27:32.770 --> 27:35.330
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice) Follow me to complete your enrollment.

504
27:38.010 --> 27:38.730
(Wang! Over here!)

505
27:39.010 --> 27:39.380
(Over here!)

506
27:39.570 --> 27:40.570
(Mr. Li! Stop him!)

507
27:41.220 --> 27:41.500
(This way!)

508
27:41.550 --> 27:42.140
About earlier...

509
27:42.900 --> 27:43.460
Thank you.

510
27:44.380 --> 27:44.810
You're welcome.

511
27:45.490 --> 27:46.490
Actually, I should be thanking you.

512
27:47.250 --> 27:47.900
To tell you the truth,

513
27:48.570 --> 27:50.290
without using your connection to the princess,

514
27:51.050 --> 27:52.250
I'd never have gotten into the Imperial Academy.

515
27:55.620 --> 27:56.290
Wei Shu, wait!

516
28:02.380 --> 28:02.810
Yan Shang.

517
28:03.620 --> 28:04.660
Though I belong to the Wei clan,

518
28:05.380 --> 28:06.530
I'm only a concubine's son from a lesser branch.

519
28:07.620 --> 28:08.570
But I'm not the princess's...

520
28:10.220 --> 28:10.730
Her...

521
28:13.010 --> 28:13.660
Male favorite?

522
28:14.940 --> 28:15.460
I'm not!

523
28:17.980 --> 28:18.620
Neither are you?

524
28:20.050 --> 28:20.530
Neither?

525
28:23.660 --> 28:24.180
Anyway,

526
28:24.980 --> 28:26.140
even if you befriend me,

527
28:26.570 --> 28:27.570
I can't do much for you.

528
28:30.570 --> 28:31.010
Wei Shu,

529
28:33.860 --> 28:34.330
you're overthinking it.

530
28:35.660 --> 28:36.770
I'm from Lingnan.

531
28:37.330 --> 28:38.420
My family makes a living farming.

532
28:39.380 --> 28:40.180
Would you be willing

533
28:40.700 --> 28:42.490
to be friends with a humble country boy like me?

534
28:48.250 --> 28:48.730
Yan Shang.

535
28:49.700 --> 28:50.460
I'm ashamed of myself.

536
28:51.250 --> 28:52.620
I judged you by my own petty standards.

537
28:58.980 --> 28:59.380
Come on.

538
29:00.090 --> 29:00.860
Let's look around outside.

539
29:01.900 --> 29:02.700
I'm new to Sheng'an,

540
29:03.090 --> 29:03.860
so I'll need you, Wei Shu,

541
29:04.460 --> 29:05.490
to show me around.

542
29:06.420 --> 29:06.810
Of course.

543
29:07.380 --> 29:07.700
Sure.

544
29:08.460 --> 29:08.730
Let's go.

545
29:12.250 --> 29:13.630
(Stop teasing us! Come on!)

546
29:13.680 --> 29:14.430
(Just show us already!)

547
29:14.480 --> 29:15.250
- Gentlemen! - (Let us see!)

548
29:15.380 --> 29:16.530
- Please, be patient. - (What's so special about it?)

549
29:16.980 --> 29:18.490
Today, I spent a fortune

550
29:19.180 --> 29:20.460
to acquire this inkstone.

551
29:21.140 --> 29:21.540
Let us see it.

552
29:21.590 --> 29:22.770
I'm afraid I can't show it to you.

553
29:23.380 --> 29:24.490
This inkstone is priceless.

554
29:24.700 --> 29:25.570
It can't be shown to just anyone.

555
29:25.980 --> 29:26.900
At noon today,

556
29:27.290 --> 29:28.620
at Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward,

557
29:29.250 --> 29:30.940
I'll unveil the inkstone for all to see.

558
29:31.330 --> 29:32.010
I invite you all

559
29:32.620 --> 29:33.460
to feast your eyes on it!

560
29:34.620 --> 29:35.460
(Tea Aromas Abound; Wenyan Studio) (All right! All right!)

561
29:35.510 --> 29:35.950
(I'll definitely be there!)

562
29:36.000 --> 29:36.460
(It's a deal!)

563
29:36.510 --> 29:38.330
We'll certainly come and see it!

564
29:39.380 --> 29:41.290
(I don't believe it. What's so special about an inkstone?)

565
29:43.180 --> 29:43.460
(Right!)

566
29:43.860 --> 29:44.910
(Let's see if this treasure is the real deal!)

567
29:44.960 --> 29:45.460
Yan Shang.

568
29:46.250 --> 29:47.570
Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward

569
29:47.900 --> 29:49.290
(Tea Aromas Abound; Wenyan Studio) is where the capital's rich

570
29:49.460 --> 29:50.570
and powerful gather to spend money like water.

571
29:53.140 --> 29:54.940
Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward...

572
29:56.140 --> 29:56.490
Wei Shu,

573
29:57.140 --> 29:58.570
let's go see this treasure for ourselves.

574
29:59.530 --> 30:00.220
I think I'll...

575
30:00.980 --> 30:01.460
pass.

576
30:01.530 --> 30:02.590
(Unveil it! Unveil it!)

577
30:02.640 --> 30:03.020
Excuse me.

578
30:03.070 --> 30:09.070
(Unveil it! Unveil it! Unveil it!)

579
30:09.070 --> 30:15.880
(Unveil it! Unveil it! Unveil it!)

580
30:22.660 --> 30:23.900
(There's nothing special about it.)

581
30:24.980 --> 30:25.670
(That's supposed to be a treasure?)

582
30:25.720 --> 30:26.630
(Feng Xianyu, Imperial Exam Candidate) My name is Feng Xianyu.

583
30:26.680 --> 30:27.380
(Did we get tricked?)

584
30:28.250 --> 30:29.570
I've studied tirelessly for ten years,

585
30:30.180 --> 30:31.140
devouring countless books.

586
30:31.530 --> 30:33.810
Yet I've had no chance to fulfill my ambitions.

587
30:35.140 --> 30:36.570
Just like this inkstone,

588
30:37.250 --> 30:38.140
I'm buried in obscurity,

589
30:38.730 --> 30:39.460
unnoticed by anyone.

590
30:43.050 --> 30:44.630
(That cost a thousand qian!)

591
30:44.680 --> 30:45.330
(And he just smashed it!)

592
30:45.660 --> 30:46.570
A mere stone.

593
30:47.380 --> 30:49.010
All it takes is some empty praise

594
30:49.570 --> 30:51.010
to draw crowds from across the city.

595
30:51.620 --> 30:52.460
Yet I, Feng Xianyu,

596
30:53.700 --> 30:55.090
am worth less than a worthless rock!

597
31:01.420 --> 31:01.940
Excuse me.

598
31:04.140 --> 31:05.770
Feng Xianyu, did you invite us here

599
31:06.460 --> 31:08.530
just to watch you smash an inkstone?

600
31:09.290 --> 31:09.620
No.

601
31:10.530 --> 31:12.290
I wanted everyone to read my writing.

602
31:13.860 --> 31:15.090
This so-called treasure may be a fake,

603
31:16.050 --> 31:17.460
but my gift for poetry

604
31:18.290 --> 31:19.140
is the real thing!

605
31:22.020 --> 31:25.260
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed, it hums with the river's endless roar.)

606
31:31.860 --> 31:34.700
How many autumns have I spent a stranger in Sheng'an?

607
31:37.420 --> 31:40.490
In autumn winds, I ride alone and climb the tower.

608
31:41.460 --> 31:44.050
My sword remains untested, its spirit sheathed,

609
31:48.530 --> 31:52.330
yet flows with the river's roar, day and night.

610
31:59.460 --> 32:00.170
What a wonderful poem!

611
32:00.220 --> 32:00.730
(Brilliant poetry!)

612
32:01.090 --> 32:01.700
(Beautifully written!)

613
32:01.750 --> 32:02.540
- Excellent poem! - (Wonderful!)

614
32:02.590 --> 32:03.620
(Especially that line!)

615
32:04.180 --> 32:04.660
(Bravo!)

616
32:04.860 --> 32:05.330
(Marvelous!)

617
32:06.490 --> 32:07.420
(Outstanding!)

618
32:08.240 --> 32:11.620
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed, it hums with the river's endless roar.)

619
32:13.010 --> 32:13.900
(What a brilliant poem!)

620
32:14.180 --> 32:15.150
(Yes! That's him!)

621
32:15.200 --> 32:16.110
- (What a remarkable young talent!) - (Magnificent!)

622
32:16.160 --> 32:16.980
- (Give me a copy too!) - (Such talent at his age!)

623
32:17.030 --> 32:18.330
(What extraordinary spirit!)

624
32:18.620 --> 32:19.150
(Excellent writing!)

625
32:19.200 --> 32:19.690
(Brilliant poem!)

626
32:19.730 --> 32:20.190
(Beautifully written!)

627
32:20.240 --> 32:20.590
(Wonderful!)

628
32:20.640 --> 32:21.780
(Marvelous! Simply marvelous!)

629
32:21.830 --> 32:22.860
(What excellent writing!)

630
32:24.140 --> 32:24.460
Wei Shu.

631
32:25.330 --> 32:27.330
You don't seem to approve of his stunt.

632
32:29.290 --> 32:30.180
It's all a cheap trick.

633
32:30.490 --> 32:31.420
No gentleman would stoop to that.

634
32:33.460 --> 32:33.810
Yan Shang,

635
32:34.570 --> 32:35.050
let's go.

636
32:36.090 --> 32:36.420
All right.

637
32:40.180 --> 32:40.860
Sir, wait!

638
32:43.980 --> 32:45.010
Thank you for recognizing my talent

639
32:45.140 --> 32:46.090
and speaking up for me today.

640
32:46.490 --> 32:47.620
May I ask your name?

641
32:48.460 --> 32:49.010
My surname is Yan.

642
32:49.380 --> 32:49.770
I'm Yan Shang.

643
32:50.380 --> 32:50.730
Yan Shang,

644
32:51.090 --> 32:52.530
without your support today,

645
32:52.980 --> 32:54.730
I'd have been talking to myself!

646
32:55.420 --> 32:56.250
You have a gift for poetry.

647
32:56.730 --> 32:57.940
Whether I'd spoken up or not,

648
32:58.330 --> 32:59.180
someone would eventually recognize your talent.

649
33:00.730 --> 33:02.180
I'm afraid by the time someone recognizes it,

650
33:02.290 --> 33:03.330
I'll already be a dead man.

651
33:03.940 --> 33:04.770
But in any case,

652
33:05.220 --> 33:05.660
today,

653
33:06.220 --> 33:07.570
I insist on treating you to a proper drink.

654
33:11.050 --> 33:13.140
Well, how could I refuse?

655
33:14.250 --> 33:14.700
Yan Shang.

656
33:15.290 --> 33:16.730
Sir, why don't you join us?

657
33:17.770 --> 33:18.140
No, thanks.

658
33:18.940 --> 33:19.420
Let's go.

659
33:19.770 --> 33:20.900
Go. Go.

660
33:24.460 --> 33:26.660
What an incredible coincidence!

661
33:27.860 --> 33:29.050
I study at the Imperial Academy too.

662
33:29.460 --> 33:31.490
But in all my time attending classes,

663
33:31.620 --> 33:33.050
I don't recall seeing either of you.

664
33:33.490 --> 33:34.900
We only enrolled today.

665
33:35.380 --> 33:36.290
That makes it even more remarkable!

666
33:36.900 --> 33:38.530
Had we met a day earlier, we wouldn't even be classmates!

667
33:39.090 --> 33:39.980
What a stroke of fate!

668
33:40.250 --> 33:41.140
That calls for a toast!

669
33:50.940 --> 33:53.090
Feng Xianyu, when did you enroll at the Imperial Academy?

670
33:53.900 --> 33:54.700
I'm ashamed to say,

671
33:55.380 --> 33:57.220
I've been studying there for five years

672
33:57.770 --> 33:58.860
and failed the exams every year.

673
33:59.980 --> 34:01.090
Otherwise,

674
34:01.380 --> 34:03.090
why would I resort to such a publicity stunt?

675
34:06.050 --> 34:08.050
(Mu Wanyao was right.)

676
34:09.570 --> 34:11.650
(Sheng'an truly is full of talented people.)

677
34:13.210 --> 34:14.430
(With such literary talent)

678
34:14.480 --> 34:15.860
(and such a flair for scheming,)

679
34:16.780 --> 34:18.820
(there's probably nothing this man wouldn't do.)

680
34:19.010 --> 34:19.380
Have some food.

681
34:20.720 --> 34:26.340
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed, it hums with the river's endless roar.)

682
34:26.340 --> 34:31.960
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed, it hums with the river's endless roar.)

683
34:32.260 --> 34:35.260
(Xu Mianmian, Singer at Cuiyun Tower)

684
34:35.360 --> 34:39.440
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed, it hums with the river's endless roar.)

685
34:40.650 --> 34:41.260
Come on!

686
34:43.740 --> 34:44.820
- Come here, Mianmian! - Sir!

687
34:45.380 --> 34:45.980
(Please! Stop!)

688
34:46.030 --> 34:46.780
(What are you doing?)

689
34:47.050 --> 34:48.650
- (Let go!) - (You're so beautiful!)

690
34:48.860 --> 34:50.460
(Sir, let go of me!)

691
34:50.650 --> 34:50.910
(Come here!)

692
34:50.960 --> 34:51.610
(This is outrageous!)

693
34:51.690 --> 34:52.300
(Sir!)

694
34:52.650 --> 34:53.270
(Don't be scared.)

695
34:53.320 --> 34:54.100
(Sir, please don't!)

696
34:54.150 --> 34:55.300
(Let me take you out for some fun!)

697
34:55.650 --> 34:56.650
(Sir, stop it!)

698
34:57.610 --> 34:58.260
(I don't want to!)

699
34:58.940 --> 34:59.580
(Sir!)

700
34:59.630 --> 35:00.100
(Don't run away!)

701
35:00.150 --> 35:01.060
(Sir, this isn't right!)

702
35:01.110 --> 35:02.210
- (Please let me go!) - (Don't run!)

703
35:02.300 --> 35:02.780
(Come with me!)

704
35:02.860 --> 35:03.210
Yan Shang.

705
35:04.010 --> 35:04.780
Don't try to play the hero.

706
35:06.530 --> 35:07.690
That man's name is Zhang Renjing.

707
35:08.170 --> 35:10.340
He's an illiterate thug from the Shence Army.

708
35:11.050 --> 35:12.010
He's killed countless people.

709
35:12.090 --> 35:12.460
Get lost!

710
35:12.530 --> 35:14.090
He earned an officer's rank through his military exploits

711
35:14.610 --> 35:15.820
and was recently transferred to Sheng'an.

712
35:16.260 --> 35:17.350
He's one of Lord Yu's favorites.

713
35:17.400 --> 35:18.140
(Please, sir! Let me go!)

714
35:18.190 --> 35:19.490
Everyone in the capital steers clear of him.

715
35:19.570 --> 35:20.100
(I'm begging you!)

716
35:20.150 --> 35:20.570
(Come on!)

717
35:21.530 --> 35:22.050
Zhang...

718
35:23.940 --> 35:24.490
Ren...

719
35:26.340 --> 35:26.780
jing...

720
35:31.740 --> 35:32.740
How do you write his name?

721
35:32.940 --> 35:33.780
Ren, meaning "person."

722
35:34.650 --> 35:35.300
Jing, meaning "to quell rebellion."

723
35:41.860 --> 35:42.650
You've misunderstood, Feng Xianyu.

724
35:44.170 --> 35:45.610
I merely want to catch up

725
35:47.010 --> 35:47.820
with Captain Zhang.

726
35:49.940 --> 35:50.380
Yan Shang!

727
35:58.650 --> 35:59.130
Captain.

728
35:59.860 --> 36:00.570
It's been a long time.

729
36:01.010 --> 36:02.010
And you are...?

730
36:03.860 --> 36:05.170
You must meet so many people, Captain.

731
36:05.780 --> 36:06.420
Don't you remember me?

732
36:12.690 --> 36:14.300
You're that...

733
36:17.460 --> 36:18.460
My surname is Yan.

734
36:18.940 --> 36:19.650
I'm from Lingnan.

735
36:24.460 --> 36:24.980
Shang.

736
36:27.210 --> 36:27.820
Shang.

737
36:29.610 --> 36:30.690
What position do you hold?

738
36:30.860 --> 36:31.570
I am

739
36:32.260 --> 36:33.050
just a commoner.

740
36:33.460 --> 36:34.420
I hold no official rank or degree.

741
36:35.170 --> 36:36.710
Then why the hell are you

742
36:36.760 --> 36:37.740
acting all friendly with me?

743
36:38.460 --> 36:38.780
Get lost!

744
36:40.650 --> 36:41.010
Where is she?

745
36:42.340 --> 36:42.900
Where is she?

746
36:44.490 --> 36:44.900
Where is she?

747
36:45.130 --> 36:46.290
(Let's go! Hurry!)

748
36:46.340 --> 36:47.090
(Quick! Get out of here!)

749
36:47.210 --> 36:47.820
(Go! Go!)

750
36:50.170 --> 36:50.780
Where did she run off to?

751
36:51.980 --> 36:52.340
Yan Shang.

752
36:53.170 --> 36:53.740
Are you all right?

753
36:55.300 --> 36:55.610
I'm fine.

754
36:55.820 --> 36:56.170
Yan Shang.

755
36:57.050 --> 36:58.130
That man is an uncouth brute.

756
36:58.820 --> 36:59.860
Don't stoop to his level.

757
37:00.900 --> 37:01.460
But...

758
37:02.420 --> 37:03.420
how do you know him?

759
37:07.490 --> 37:08.650
I've known him for many years.

760
37:09.570 --> 37:10.300
He's just forgotten.

761
37:13.340 --> 37:14.860
We've heard poetry and enjoyed our wine.

762
37:15.170 --> 37:16.090
We've had our fun. Time to go.

763
37:16.610 --> 37:16.940
Let's go.

764
37:18.570 --> 37:18.900
Let's go.

765
37:21.570 --> 37:23.020
(Cuiyun Tower) (Come take a look!)

766
37:23.070 --> 37:24.860
(Hot steamed buns!)

767
37:25.650 --> 37:28.170
(Freshly steamed buns!)

768
37:29.460 --> 37:30.650
(Come try some!)

769
37:32.340 --> 37:33.570
You're blocking the road!

770
37:33.940 --> 37:34.300
(Hurry up!)

771
37:34.460 --> 37:34.950
Can't you see the carriage?

772
37:35.000 --> 37:35.490
(Get moving!)

773
37:35.690 --> 37:36.300
- (Move aside!) - (I'm talking to you!)

774
37:36.690 --> 37:37.370
(What are you staring at?)

775
37:37.420 --> 37:37.820
(Move!)

776
37:38.570 --> 37:40.490
So that's Grand Princess Luling's carriage.

777
37:40.940 --> 37:41.570
No wonder.

778
37:42.420 --> 37:44.940
Do all the princesses in our dynasty make such a grand entrance?

779
37:46.460 --> 37:48.260
Not all princesses are alike.

780
37:49.010 --> 37:49.940
I've heard of her.

781
37:50.210 --> 37:50.940
She's a Taoist priestess.

782
37:51.610 --> 37:52.490
She's supposed to have renounced worldly pursuits.

783
37:52.860 --> 37:53.820
Why would she be so arrogant?

784
37:54.380 --> 37:56.170
Wei Shu, there's something you don't know.

785
37:56.570 --> 37:59.130
Grand Princess Luling is notoriously lustful and cruel.

786
37:59.650 --> 38:01.260
Widowed at a young age, she refused to remarry,

787
38:01.380 --> 38:02.690
so she became a Taoist priestess instead.

788
38:03.210 --> 38:05.940
I hear she keeps over a dozen male favorites at her residence.

789
38:07.010 --> 38:09.090
If a favorite or servant says one wrong word,

790
38:09.530 --> 38:10.570
they're often beaten to death on the spot.

791
38:11.130 --> 38:13.460
Sheng'an is crawling with powerful nobles,

792
38:13.980 --> 38:15.900
but she's the most tyrannical of them all.

793
38:16.380 --> 38:18.010
Speaking of the most powerful person in Sheng'an,

794
38:18.650 --> 38:19.690
wouldn't that be Lord Yu?

795
38:21.780 --> 38:23.210
Very perceptive of you.

796
38:24.940 --> 38:26.820
The Grand Princess can behave so outrageously

797
38:27.490 --> 38:28.650
not because she belongs to the Mu royal family.

798
38:29.820 --> 38:32.570
I hear she's known Lord Yu for decades,

799
38:33.010 --> 38:33.820
and they're very close.

800
38:34.380 --> 38:35.820
That's why she can throw her weight around in Sheng'an

801
38:36.460 --> 38:37.130
- without fear of consequences. - (Behave yourself!)

802
38:37.940 --> 38:38.420
(I'm talking to you!)

803
38:45.860 --> 38:47.260
What kind of incense are they burning in that carriage?

804
38:47.780 --> 38:48.820
The smell is so overpowering.

805
38:50.210 --> 38:51.780
Wei Shu, you clearly don't know the good stuff!

806
38:51.860 --> 38:53.980
That's incense specially made for the Grand Princess.

807
38:54.050 --> 38:55.050
You won't find it anywhere else.

808
38:59.740 --> 39:00.900
(The Grand Princess's procession is approaching!)

809
39:01.260 --> 39:02.340
(Carriages ahead, fall back!)

810
39:05.780 --> 39:06.380
(Get out of the way!)

811
39:07.460 --> 39:08.610
(Isn't that Princess Danyang's carriage?)

812
39:09.260 --> 39:09.900
(Let's go have a look!)

813
39:11.490 --> 39:12.460
(How dare you come any closer!)

814
39:12.860 --> 39:13.260
(Move!)

815
39:13.860 --> 39:14.610
(You got a death wish?)

816
39:15.570 --> 39:16.490
(Can't you speak properly?)

817
39:16.860 --> 39:17.300
(How dare you!)

818
39:17.820 --> 39:18.420
(Get out of my way!)

819
39:19.170 --> 39:20.780
(Did you hear me? Move!)

820
39:25.340 --> 39:25.820
Aunt.

821
39:26.460 --> 39:27.380
It's been a long time.

822
39:41.650 --> 39:42.460
Danyang.

823
39:43.050 --> 39:44.010
My respects, Aunt.

824
39:47.100 --> 39:49.020
(Mu Ningshuang, Grand Princess Luling)

825
39:52.740 --> 39:53.210
Fall back.

826
39:53.820 --> 39:54.690
Let my aunt go first.

827
39:55.210 --> 39:56.780
(You heard her! Move back!)

828
39:57.420 --> 39:58.050
(Don't block the way!)

829
39:58.650 --> 39:59.210
(Don't block the way!)

830
40:00.050 --> 40:00.530
(Move!)

831
40:00.900 --> 40:01.340
(Move!)

832
40:01.900 --> 40:02.380
(Hurry up!)

833
40:12.090 --> 40:12.460
(Move!)

834
40:13.170 --> 40:13.570
(Move!)

835
40:13.780 --> 40:14.900
(Move aside! Fall back!)

836
40:15.690 --> 40:16.010
(Back!)

837
40:16.210 --> 40:16.570
(Back!)

838
40:16.980 --> 40:17.300
(Back!)

839
40:27.090 --> 40:28.130
Safe travels, Aunt.

840
40:45.020 --> 40:49.960
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing across your brow♪

841
40:52.310 --> 40:57.120
♪Let me hold you whenever the rain falls♪

842
40:57.700 --> 41:00.060
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

843
41:01.460 --> 41:01.900
Your Highness.

844
41:02.050 --> 41:03.550
♪Burning bright as a song♪

845
41:05.380 --> 41:05.740
Your Highness.

846
41:07.620 --> 41:12.130
♪Be the promise I hold deep in my heart♪

847
41:14.010 --> 41:14.490
Shu.

848
41:15.900 --> 41:17.930
Did your enrollment go smoothly?

849
41:17.980 --> 41:19.590
♪Not a single hour less♪

850
41:20.570 --> 41:21.170
Yes, Your Highness.

851
41:21.980 --> 41:23.780
I enrolled at the Imperial Academy today.

852
41:26.940 --> 41:29.130
Did anyone give you trouble there?

853
41:30.380 --> 41:30.820
No.

854
41:31.690 --> 41:33.050
In fact, I made two new friends.

855
41:34.010 --> 41:34.780
This is Feng...

856
41:37.260 --> 41:38.610
This isn't the place to talk.

857
41:39.090 --> 41:40.860
Come see me at my residence tonight.

858
41:41.390 --> 41:43.150
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock in dusk♪

859
41:43.200 --> 41:43.830
♪May time be free of pain; - lights fade, and seasons turn♪

860
41:44.740 --> 41:45.090
Let's go.

861
41:46.160 --> 41:48.310
♪You're the only one I need♪

862
41:48.640 --> 41:55.630
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

863
41:55.780 --> 41:57.600
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

864
41:58.000 --> 41:58.950
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

865
41:59.500 --> 42:01.560
♪My last untouched innocence♪

866
42:02.570 --> 42:03.130
Yan Shang.

867
42:03.490 --> 42:05.900
Why did the princess seem to ignore you just now?

868
42:13.530 --> 42:14.610
Wei Shu. Yan Shang.

869
42:14.980 --> 42:16.860
You both know Princess Danyang?

870
42:36.650 --> 42:37.050
What's wrong?

871
42:37.940 --> 42:38.460
Yan Shang,

872
42:39.420 --> 42:41.780
the princess asked me to visit her residence tonight.

873
42:42.340 --> 42:43.380
Was she serious,

874
42:43.820 --> 42:44.820
or was she just teasing me?

875
42:45.610 --> 42:46.740
Whether she was joking or not,

876
42:47.420 --> 42:48.050
you should go.

877
42:50.940 --> 42:52.300
Matters of the heart

878
42:53.170 --> 42:55.460
really are more complicated than alchemy.

879
42:57.610 --> 42:58.010
(Hey, you over there!)

880
42:58.530 --> 42:59.900
(We're one player short for foot polo!)

881
43:00.170 --> 43:00.530
(Want to join?)

882
43:01.940 --> 43:02.900
We'll pass.

883
43:03.300 --> 43:04.340
I don't know how to play anyway.

884
43:04.860 --> 43:05.570
Neither do I.

885
43:10.050 --> 43:11.010
I've never played foot polo.

886
43:11.490 --> 43:12.090
Can I still join?

887
43:12.650 --> 43:13.140
Of course!

888
43:13.190 --> 43:13.620
(We can teach you!)

889
43:13.670 --> 43:14.530
(Sure! No problem!)

890
43:14.650 --> 43:15.020
(Come on! Let's go!)

891
43:15.070 --> 43:15.710
(We'll teach you! Come on!)

892
43:15.760 --> 43:16.060
(Let's go!)

893
43:16.110 --> 43:17.120
(Just come along!)

894
43:17.170 --> 43:17.530
(Come on!)

895
43:20.130 --> 43:21.420
Yan Shang is so easygoing.

896
43:22.610 --> 43:23.460
Someone like him

897
43:24.300 --> 43:25.610
must be well-liked by everyone.

898
43:27.530 --> 43:28.780
Wei Shu, may I have a word in private?

899
43:32.860 --> 43:34.340
I have a rather presumptuous favor

900
43:34.690 --> 43:35.780
to ask of you.

901
43:36.090 --> 43:37.130
Go ahead.

902
43:42.210 --> 43:44.130
Could you introduce me to Princess Danyang?

903
43:49.980 --> 43:50.910
(Imperial Academy) (What a magnificent carriage!)

904
43:50.960 --> 43:51.820
(And look at those horses!)

905
43:52.170 --> 43:53.300
(They're so strong and magnificent!)

906
43:53.530 --> 43:54.570
(I feel like I've seen them somewhere before.)

907
43:55.650 --> 43:56.940
(Isn't that the princess's carriage?)

908
43:57.090 --> 43:57.570
(That's right!)

909
43:58.530 --> 43:59.610
(Who's it here to pick up?)

910
43:59.780 --> 44:00.690
(Don't you recognize that carriage roof?)

911
44:00.860 --> 44:01.490
(No idea!)

912
44:01.690 --> 44:02.260
(No way!)

913
44:02.690 --> 44:03.750
(Princess Danyang's carriage?)

914
44:03.800 --> 44:04.730
(Why is it parked outside our door?)

915
44:04.780 --> 44:05.140
(Exactly!)

916
44:05.190 --> 44:06.020
(It looks like an empress's carriage!)

917
44:06.070 --> 44:06.950
(Could it be here to pick up...)

918
44:07.000 --> 44:07.350
(Possibly!)

919
44:07.400 --> 44:08.130
(It really is the princess!)

920
44:08.300 --> 44:08.950
(How could that be?)

921
44:09.000 --> 44:09.500
(Don't talk nonsense!)

922
44:09.550 --> 44:10.490
(The princess's carriage is here in person!)

923
44:10.650 --> 44:11.500
- Excuse me. - (The princess's carriage...)

924
44:11.550 --> 44:12.460
(Why would it pick up one of us?)

925
44:12.690 --> 44:13.210
Sir.

926
44:13.610 --> 44:13.940
This way, please.

927
44:14.090 --> 44:15.380
(Could it be here for him?)

928
44:16.130 --> 44:16.980
- (Nonsense!) - (Why is he getting in?)

929
44:17.380 --> 44:18.170
(I'd already heard about it!)

930
44:18.740 --> 44:20.170
(Wei Shu has close ties to the princess's residence.)

931
44:21.980 --> 44:22.690
(So the rumors are true!)

932
44:23.190 --> 44:23.540
(Oh, my!)

933
44:23.590 --> 44:24.610
(I'd already heard about it.)

934
44:25.050 --> 44:26.260
(He's Princess Danyang's...)

935
44:26.570 --> 44:27.460
(It's true! It really is!)

936
44:28.240 --> 44:28.540
(Oh, dear!)

937
44:28.590 --> 44:29.940
(That's no way for a scholar to get ahead!)

938
44:40.580 --> 44:44.580
(Next Episode Preview)

939
44:46.420 --> 44:47.420
Yan Shang, come on! Hurry!

940
44:51.090 --> 44:51.860
I'll make a sacrifice

941
44:53.650 --> 44:54.170
and marry you.

942
44:54.420 --> 44:55.820
Your Highness, look who's here!

943
45:01.360 --> 45:04.653
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

944
45:07.338 --> 45:12.254
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

945
45:14.448 --> 45:20.293
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

946
45:20.793 --> 45:26.019
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

947
45:28.788 --> 45:33.579
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

948
45:34.415 --> 45:40.494
♪Through trails of mud and blood; let grief drown in your eyes♪

949
45:42.295 --> 45:45.445
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

950
45:45.445 --> 45:47.093
♪Burning bright as a song♪

951
45:47.145 --> 45:50.869
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

952
45:51.247 --> 45:55.913
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

953
45:56.532 --> 46:00.573
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

954
46:01.064 --> 46:03.179
♪Not a single hour less♪

955
46:03.219 --> 46:10.165
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

956
46:10.928 --> 46:14.381
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

957
46:14.561 --> 46:17.706
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

958
46:18.145 --> 46:24.782
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

959
46:25.179 --> 46:29.693
♪May time be free of fear and pain; boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

960
46:29.731 --> 46:32.200
♪You're the only one I need♪

961
46:32.404 --> 46:39.291
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

962
46:39.603 --> 46:42.874
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

963
46:43.179 --> 46:46.352
♪My last untouched innocence♪

964
46:46.676 --> 46:50.102
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

965
46:50.335 --> 46:53.560
